  <p class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</p>
  <h1>Short version: there's almost nothing to say.</h1>
  <p class="meta-line">Last updated 2026.</p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>asystemofcells.com runs no analytics, sets no cookies, and loads no third-party tracking scripts. There is no ad network, no session recording, and nothing here profiles you across visits.</p>
  <p>Our hosting provider may log basic technical information as a normal part of serving web pages, such as IP address, browser type, and request timestamps. That's standard web server behavior for security and reliability, not something we collect, review, or use to track individuals.</p>

  <h2>The apps</h2>
  <p>Every app in this house is built the same way: on-device by default, with no telemetry wired in. Where an app offers an optional cloud feature, that's opt-in per use, clearly marked, and never a hidden default. Specifics vary a little app to app - check an individual app's own listing for details on what it does when you turn a cloud feature on.</p>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don't sell or share data, because we don't collect it in the first place.</li>
    <li>We don't use cookies for tracking or advertising.</li>
    <li>We don't run A/B tests or behavioral analytics on this site.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>If anything here is unclear, or you want more detail on a specific app, reach out via the <a class="inline-link" href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
